# clean-me README demo — render with: vhs assets/demo.tape
# Produces assets/demo.gif (an illustrative, privacy-safe reproduction of the TUI).
Output assets/demo.gif

Require bash

Set Shell bash
Set FontSize 20
Set Width 1080
Set Height 720
Set Padding 24
Set Theme "Dracula"
Set Framerate 24
Set PlaybackSpeed 1.0

Hide
Type "bash assets/demo.sh"
Enter
Sleep 300ms
Show
Sleep 13s
